translate schinese story19_Erik_Lyna_756e575b:
    lm "{cps=20}因为……{w=0.35}乱伦这个念头……"

translate schinese story19_Erik_Lyna_feadb648:
    lm "{cps=20}让我{cps=10}{w=0.3}他、{w=0.3}妈、{w=0.3}地兴奋。"

translate schinese story19_Erik_Lyna_0ec4ebeb:
    lm "所以这样根本不够！"

translate schinese story19_Erik_Lyna_7595356e:
