translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_f2e6eda0:
    h "{size=-5}嘿！我最爱的双胞胎们过得怎么样？"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_fc439602:
    l "听到你的声音太开心了，妈妈！"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_a2e673b6:
