translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_e1ffda1a:
    h "{size=-5}哈哈，逗你的……"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_8e0fa063:
    h "{size=-5}那么，怎么突然打电话来？我洗耳恭听。"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_0a09152c:
