translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_14185cbf:
    l "对！埃里克几乎每天都在提醒我。"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_62e273e7:
    h "{size=-5}真可爱……我那贴心宝贝就该是这样。"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_d4a70a1b:
    l "嘿嘿，他超级可靠的！"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_b543d3e8:
    h "{size=-5}莱娜，有他是你福气，永远别忘了这一点……"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_4863e00c:
    l "我知道……"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_71861a16:
    l "那么，我……挂了。"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_9c4528f5:
    h "{size=-5}好，路上小心！"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_bb540226:
    l "谢谢妈妈。爱你！"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_8d6d6ac8:
    h "{size=-5}我也爱你，我的宝贝。"

translate schinese story20_Erik_Lyna_7798c9d9:
